{"steam_appid":4804480,"steam_name":"Age of Clicks","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4804480/1984355982/917115a9a35924e4da3c51d4ed66159de90539be/1784635188/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784641754","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257352069/b56610798ca5aa7ea828645a548cb6916108075b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784641754","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/469a7de3d504c308db17c59422e8e87ee28b602c/ss_469a7de3d504c308db17c59422e8e87ee28b602c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784741321","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/51be18a3028112f2625603584436c18317cf509a/ss_51be18a3028112f2625603584436c18317cf509a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784741321","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/958dc8267959a4e21fd6db04975854a73343db71/ss_958dc8267959a4e21fd6db04975854a73343db71.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784741321","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/d247d2593eb11be13e9ef6be4a356fca23c7caff/ss_d247d2593eb11be13e9ef6be4a356fca23c7caff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784741321","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/438cc3985b4d42af7907d61d43774448d04d0258/ss_438cc3985b4d42af7907d61d43774448d04d0258.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784741321"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RULE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age of Clicks is a unique blend of Grand Strategy and Idle Progression where you build a nation from the ground up, recruit powerful armies, expand your economy, and wage wars for global domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/592df9b6d35e11f7560b0be33a7aa724.poster.avif?t=1784741321\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/592df9b6d35e11f7560b0be33a7aa724.webm?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/592df9b6d35e11f7560b0be33a7aa724.mp4?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> ⚔️Build Your Army</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command infantry, armored divisions, heavy artillery, missile launchers, and advanced military technology. Expand your army from a small force into a world-conquering war machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/2ad13a655a584117ae67e7bdf473b21c.poster.avif?t=1784741321\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/2ad13a655a584117ae67e7bdf473b21c.webm?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/2ad13a655a584117ae67e7bdf473b21c.mp4?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🌍Expand Your Borders </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade neighboring countries, capture new territories, and slowly paint the entire world in your nation's colors. Every conquered nation unlocks new resources, new challenges, and even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/d04a354e8e0b92ff88ce12ccb28db486.poster.avif?t=1784741321\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/d04a354e8e0b92ff88ce12ccb28db486.webm?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/d04a354e8e0b92ff88ce12ccb28db486.mp4?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> 🏭Build a Powerful Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Strong Nation Needs a Strong Industry. Develop cities, build factories, extract resources, and create an economy capable of supporting millions of soldiers. Balance military expansion with economic growth to become an unstoppable superpower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/958a2ac3a8767d1b71330d4e9c8385f0.poster.avif?t=1784741321\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/958a2ac3a8767d1b71330d4e9c8385f0.webm?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/958a2ac3a8767d1b71330d4e9c8385f0.mp4?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🚀 Endless Progression </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research technologies, unlock powerful upgrades, automate production, strengthen your military, and discover new ways to dominate the world. There is always another upgrade… and another country waiting to fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/1ee7916ed0cd0daaac91164681b8d87d.poster.avif?t=1784741321\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/1ee7916ed0cd0daaac91164681b8d87d.webm?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4804480/extras/1ee7916ed0cd0daaac91164681b8d87d.mp4?t=1784741321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Single Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7/8/10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Single Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy","Early Access"],"developers":[" David Ius"],"publishers":[" Red Border Studio"],"release_date":"21 Jul, 2026"}